Z||000018||Fformula88||04-27-2001||03:59 PM||||Akursedx, I'll definately have to cruise down there to check it out sometime this summer!  I've only seen a couple other Formula's in this area.  There is a black one I see a lot, and another red one like mine... except it has a gray interior and mine is tan.  The guy who owns it used to work for the Pep boys on Union, but they moved out.  Haven't seen it sinse.  I also saw a yellow one, but haven't seen it in a few years.<P>By my count, we have a total of 14 real Formula's... 4 yellow 3 red and 7 unspecified in color.  There are also 3 aspiring Formula's! ||||reg||1
