Z||000032||kslish||04-28-2001||11:54 AM||||My Dad's got a real burgundy red Formula that he bought from me (but I still do all the upkeep on it).  I drove to Ohio to pick it up, the owner was doing a full restoration but lost interest and I got it for a steal.  The engine, suspension and interior have been completely restored.  It only needs a perfect paint job to look like it rolled off of the showroom floor.<P>Here's something that is sort of depressing.  I got the Formula front facia that is on my '86 Coupe from a guy in Tampa Florida that was turning his original silver Formula into a Ferrari 355 replica.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <P>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
